<title>HONG KONG: Glorious Sun up 48 pct by late morning.</title>
<headline>Glorious Sun up 48 pct by late morning.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Glorious Sun Enterprise Ltd shares were up HK$0.775 to HK$2.375 in active trade by late morning following their trading debut on Tuesday, up 48.43 percent from their issue price of HK$1.60.</p>
<p>The shares hit a high of HK$2.45 before profit-taking emerged, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;It (the surge in share price) is better than our expectation of topping at HK$2.25 to HK$2.30 on debut,&quot; said Sean Li, associate director of Amsteel Securities.</p>
